{"reviews":[{"id":"B00MVL4RXC-0","r":4.0,"t":"Decent Broach for the Price","x":"Bought them as broaches for the women in my wedding party and they were pretty. Nice fabric and great color. I liked that they had an alligator clip as well as a pin so you could wear it on your clothes or in your hair.","h":7,"v":0,"d":"Oct 2016"},{"id":"B00MVL4RXC-1","r":5.0,"t":"LOVELY FLOWER","x":"This was perfect for my outfit for my moms funeral.","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2021"},{"id":"B00MVL4RXC-2","r":4.0,"t":"Pretty!","x":"The color was not exactly like the pictures portrays. It was more of a darker pink instead of a light baby pink, however it was the exact same design as shows. The rose is still beautiful, even though the color was a little different than was I expected!","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2016"},{"id":"B00MVL4RXC-3","r":5.0,"t":"Came in a great little box and the color is more like a ...","x":"Wow, so impressed by this flower. Came in a great little box and the color is more like a teal then a green. It is beautiful!! I am actually going to order more due to the aesthetic look and quality of the flower.","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2016"},{"id":"B00MVL4RXC-4","r":1.0,"t":"Don't Waste Your Time or Money","x":"This flower came stuffed in a tiny bag. It's all smashed flat. I've tried to steam it, fluff it, starch it and nothing will get it to look like the picture. One of the worst things I have ever received.","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B00MVL4RXC-5","r":5.0,"t":"Awesomely Cute","x":"Awesomely Cute. I'm coming back for more colors.","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2017"},{"id":"B00MVL4RXC-6","r":5.0,"t":"Gorgeous!  WOW!","x":"This item is beautiful.  It is exactly as shown.  Lovely, delicate, excellent quality, perfect size.  I bought several in different colors.  When I received them I actually said out loud to no one &#34;Oh, how beautiful!&#34;","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2016"},{"id":"B00MVL4RXC-7","r":5.0,"t":"Elegant Rose!","x":"This is a lovely rose pin/clip which looks great on my pirate lady dress!  It was not crushed or damaged in anyway when I opened the packaging.  It's about 3&#34; or so in wide, so is a very nice size and looks very elegant!","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2017"},{"id":"B00MVL4RXC-8","r":5.0,"t":"It's so nice that I clipped it unto the cubicle wall at ...","x":"Got it for a costume. Really well made and actually held up. It's so nice that I clipped it unto the cubicle wall at work as a decoration after the costume party was done and over with.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2014"},{"id":"B00MVL4RXC-9","r":5.0,"t":"Great purchase!","x":"Very pretty and well made. I bought the navy blue and it looks great on my white blazer. Buying on Amazon sure beats driving to the mall and the crowds, especially searching for a parking space!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2016"},{"id":"B00MVL4RXC-10","r":5.0,"t":"Hermosa","x":"Cuando la sacas del empaque est\u00e1 arrugada y un tanto deformada, pero despu\u00e9s empieza abrir como una flor de verdad. Me encant\u00f3, comprar\u00eda otros colores.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2022"},{"id":"B00MVL4RXC-11","r":5.0,"t":"Super cute!","x":"Super adorable hair accessory!  Adds a little girlish flair to a boring bun or ponytail.  Will probably order some additional colors!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2016"},{"id":"B00MVL4RXC-12","r":3.0,"t":"Pretty flower but the pin has a cheap clasp","x":"Pretty flower but the pin has a cheap clasp. It's not the kind that locks the pin. I would say it deserves 3 1/2 stars.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2016"},{"id":"B00MVL4RXC-13","r":5.0,"t":"I have suits with Navy pants and white jacket so ...","x":"I have suits with Navy pants and white jacket so I can use it for that. Not really special design but it's o.k.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"May 2016"},{"id":"B00MVL4RXC-14","r":5.0,"t":"Five Stars","x":"Perfect size. I love you can wear it on clothes or in your hair!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2016"},{"id":"B00MVL4RXC-15","r":5.0,"t":"Color\u2019s a little off","x":"Comes with an attached safety pin and hair clip.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2020"},{"id":"B00MVL4RXC-16","r":5.0,"t":"Color\u2019s a little off","x":"Comes with an attached safety pin and hair clip.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2020"},{"id":"B00MVL4RXC-17","r":4.0,"t":"Beautiful clip","x":"I love this color and it\u2019s well made.  I also appreciate the optional pin backing to use it as a broach vs a clip.  The only complaint I have is that it was packaged in a way that left it flattened and creased.  I had to work pretty hard to get it to fluff out.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2022"},{"id":"B00MVL4RXC-18","r":5.0,"t":"Big. Bold. Beautiful.","x":"For some reason I thought these would be smaller and at first I was disappointed. I played with them a little bit and love them as a fun after-hours addition to my work bun. They\u2019re actually prettier in person and well made.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2019"},{"id":"B00MVL4RXC-19","r":5.0,"t":"beautiful rose clip","x":"Wow! I really loved this rose hairclip! I got a lot of compliments on it. I wore it to a wedding and it definitely completed my outfit. Great quality, looks like it costs way more than I paid for :)","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2017"},{"id":"B00MVL4RXC-20","r":5.0,"t":"Pretty in Pink","x":"The flower came in a flat package. But it easily fluffed up as you see in the picture. I will use it as a pin/brooch. i recommend this product. Super fast delivery.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2022"},{"id":"B00MVL4RXC-21","r":3.0,"t":"Was not what I expected.","x":"Didn't really like it, but I didn't send it back because it probably would have cost more money to send it back than what I paid for it.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2022"},{"id":"B00MVL4RXC-22","r":4.0,"t":"Color","x":"It is just the color I was looking for (dark blue).  I have items of clothing in that color, so I will clip the flower to my straw bag.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2022"},{"id":"B00MVL4RXC-23","r":5.0,"t":"Beautiful bright red flower!","x":"This bright red vibrant flower is a wonderful addition to any outfit!  I always get compliments on it from even strangers!  I love it.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2022"},{"id":"B00MVL4RXC-24","r":4.0,"t":"It is lovely, but small and the pink is more like red.","x":"This is a plain but nice fabric flower with both a clip and brooch pin to attach to clothing or hair.  The pink one looks nearly red.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2022"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Reviewers frequently describe the flower as beautiful, pretty, or lovely.","cites":[2,3,4,7,8,10,11,13]},{"text":"Many customers praise the quality and construction, saying it is well made and holds up.","cites":[4,7,9,10]},{"text":"Several reviewers note the color differs somewhat from the photos, though the flower is still attractive.","cites":[3,4]},{"text":"Some customers report the flower arrives crushed, wrinkled, or deformed in the packaging.","cites":[5,11]},{"text":"Reviewers appreciate the dual pin/clip design and the ability to wear it on clothes or in hair.","cites":[1,8,12,15]}]},"qa":[]}